# Per-item, per-step raw records from evaluation/instrumentation passes
# (§7, model/raw_records.py). Regenerable from a checkpoint + its seeds;
# kept out of git even though volume is modest (~8MB/run) — the run's
# checkpoint plus PREREG.md's logged seeds fully determine them. The
# manifest (small, summary only) stays tracked.
raw/*.jsonl
